

<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Gridiron Auctions</title>

<style>

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {

  margin: 0;

  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;

  background: #101820;

  color: white;

}

header {

  background: #172631;

  padding: 22px;

  text-align: center;

  border-bottom: 3px solid #39c878;

}

header h1 { margin: 0; color: #39c878; }

header p { color: #b8c5cc; }

main {

  max-width: 500px;

  margin: 45px auto;

  padding: 20px;

}

.panel {

  background: #1c2c37;

  padding: 25px;

  border-radius: 14px;

  margin-bottom: 20px;

}

h2 { margin-top: 0; }

button {

  width: 100%;

  padding: 15px;

  margin-top: 12px;

  border: 0;

  border-radius: 8px;

  background: #39c878;

  color: #102018;

  font-size: 16px;

  font-weight: bold;

}

input {

  width: 100%;

  padding: 14px;

  margin-top: 10px;

  border: 1px solid #52636e;

  border-radius: 8px;

  background: #101820;

  color: white;

  font-size: 16px;

}

.note {

  color: #b8c5cc;

  font-size: 13px;

  text-align: center;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>

  <h1>🏈 GRIDIRON AUCTIONS</h1>

  <p>Your NFL Player Auction Headquarters</p>

</header>

<main>

  <section class="panel">

    <h2>Create an Auction</h2>

    <p>Start a room, choose a virtual budget, and invite your friends.</p>

    <button disabled>Create Auction Room</button>

  </section>

  <section class="panel">

    <h2>Join an Auction</h2>

    <p>Enter your room code to join your friends.</p>

    <input placeholder="Enter room code">

    <button disabled>Join Auction</button>

  </section>

  <p class="note">Virtual points only • Compete with your friends</p>

</main>

</body>

</html>
